  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 21",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inong'ho lya nkīma nchīlwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabūūcha miso, ūbabona a basabi balītūūla manong'ho gabo ng'wibīkīlo lya sabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmona na nkīma nchīlwa hangī ng'habī, watūūla mo nang'hwe hela jakwe ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Seeba ūhaya, “Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ū nkīma ū nchīlwa na ng'habī ng'wenūyū, watūūla mo shingī kūtinda pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bangī balītūūla a manong'ho gabo kūfuma mu būshiigo bo sabo jabo, alīyo ū nkīma ng'wenūyū, nūūlū īkī alī na makoye, watūūla mo pyī īsho walī nasho, kūlwa kwigunanhīla mu būpanga bokwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkambagūlwa kwa hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bamona bamò bandya kwīhaya ī hekalu, ūmo yalī īzengilwe na mawe masoga; na a manong'ho ayo gafunyiagwa moi. Nang'hwe ūhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A gose aya mulīgabona genaya, jikūshika shikū lītūsaaga iwe higūlya y'iwe lichalyo, īlo lītūholomolelwa ha sī!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandījo bo makoye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būmūja gīkī, “Nangi ī mihayo yenīyī īkūbiza ho nanalī? Shikūbiza ho shimanīkījo kī ūlū yegeela kwilonga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Ilang'hanagi, yaya ū kūlemva lemva. Nguno bingī bakūyiza mu lina lyane balīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū nene hū nalī ng'wene;’ na gīkī, ‘Lyegeelaga ī likanza.’ Yaya ū kūbalondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ng'wandya kwigwa ng'hūlū ja mabūlūgū na mawiyugagūji, yaya ū kogoha, nguno ī yenīyī shiigelile ītonge ū kūbiza ho, alīyo h'ītī gīkī ī ngelelo yashikaga na kūshika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ongeja kūbawīla gīkī, “Būkūbiza ho wiyūbūkīji ha gatī y'ihanga n'ihanga, na būtemi kū būtemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na jikūyūding'hima nyahīnga nhaale, na kwilonga mahūūya, na nzala ng'halī mu mapandī na mapandī. Īkūyilonga mihayo ya kogohya, na shimanīkījo shitaale kūfuma ng'wilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho ītaalī ū kwilonga pyī ī yose īyī, bakūyūmudima bamutwala kū masinagogi na mu jeela, kūjūmuluhya; mukūshishiwa na kū būtongi bo batemi na basugi kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī yenīyī īkūgalūka kūbiza ya būkaanīji ū kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bing'we timbyagi ng'holò, yaya ū kwandya kwiganika ganika ūmo mulayūshokeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nakūng'winha kahayīle na masala, ayo batūdūla kūgīmīla nūūlū kūgaheeba a bilwisha bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nīyo nūūlū babyaji bing'we bakūyūmulodeela, pye nūūlū baana bang'wing'we na a badūgū bing'we na a banwani biching'wi; na bamò bing'we bakūyūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pye a banhū bakūmukolwa kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lūtūjimīīla nūūlū ni lūywīlī lo kū ntwe gwing'we dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wiyūmīlīja, mukūbūpīja ū būpanga wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būluhi būtaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwike ūlū ng'ūgūbona ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu gwapīndiwa na mabita, managi gīkī lyegeelaga ī likanza lya kūkenaagūlwa kwago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho abo balī mu sī ya Būyudaya ni bapeelelage kū ngūlū; na a babo balī mu nzengo bafume mo, hangī abo balī kū chalo sha hanze batiziza kwingīla mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shikū jenījo jikūbiza ja kūmalīlwa shiilī, na kūshikīlījiwa kwa mihayo yose īyo yandīkilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo bakūbiza mu makoye mataale no abo bakūsangwa balī nda, na a babo bakonhyaga. Nguno būkūbiza ho būluhi būtaale no ū mu sī, na būpelanīlwa ū kū banhū benaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūyūbūlagwa bo shū, na bakūding'wa nding'wa basalang'hanījiwe mu mahanga gose. Ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu gūkūtobangwa na banhū ba mahanga gangī kūshisha gashikīīle a makanza ga banhū ba mahanga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiza kwa Ng'wana wa Munhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna shikūbiza ho shimanīkījo ū kū līīmi nū kū ng'weji, nū kū sonda. Hanuma a mahanga ga mu sī gakwandya kūyibakīla bakīla, kūlwa kogoha ng'huutumo gwa mahuuli ga nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakūyūchenuka ng'holò kūshisha kūkaba kūlwa boba, nguno ya kwīlindīīla īyo īlabagwīle pye a bikaji ba mu sī. Nguno ū būdūla bo ng'wigūlū būkūtinginyiwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna bakūmona ū Ng'wana wa Munhū alī ng'wilunde, aliza na būdūla n'ikūjo itaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūbona yandya kūja gīko, īmīīlagi hīgīyī, mubūūche ī mitwe ying'we, nguno numho ū būpīji wing'we wegeelaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilangīlagi kū ntini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla lūsumo gīkī, “Gūlolagi ū ntini, nī mitī ī yīngī pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū yandya kūfuluma mukamanaga gīkī gwegeelaga ū ng'waka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nī haha ū kū bing'we; ūlū ng'ūbona yandya kwilonga ī yenīyī, managi gīkī ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu wegeelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ī shibyalīlwe īshi shitūbīta kūshisha pyī ī yose yilonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ligūlū nī sī shikūbīta, alīyo ī mihayo yane ītīko kūjimīīla na hado yaya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi mutizilendeja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna lūūlū ilang'hanagi mutizilendeja, īng'holò jing'we jitizūheewa na būponanja bo sabo, nūūlū būleevi na kūkoya koyela ya būpanga ūbū, nose ū lūshikū lwenūlo lūng'wisanganīje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bikaji ba mu sī yose lūkūbisanganīja, gītī lūtu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ikalagi nzūgūlū matū, mubize ba kūlomba mu kwikūmbīlīja būlī ikanza, mulapūlūgūke; ītizūmugwīla ī yose īyo īlī hihī kwiza. Mubize na būdūla bo kwīmīīla ū kū būtongi bo Ng'wana wa Munhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū ī līīmi wadīlaga mu hekalu akūlangaga, alīyo ī būjikū wafumaga waja kūlaala kū lūgūlū ūlo lūkitanagwa lwa mizeituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wela ī dilū pye a banhū bang'wipunīīlaga, kwiza kūndegeleka ū mu hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
